Write the file /app/rtl/ibex_tracer_pkg.sv with the following content. This is the Ibex tracer package that defines types for the RISC-V instruction tracer. It needs to define:
- Register name strings
- Opcodes for RV32I/M/C instructions
- A tracer_insn_t struct

Here is the content to write:

```systemverilog
// Copyright lowRISC contributors.
// Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, see LICENSE for details.
// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

package ibex_tracer_pkg;

  typedef struct packed {
    logic [31:0] insn;
    logic [31:0] pc;
    logic        trap;
    logic [4:0]  rs1_addr;
    logic [4:0]  rs2_addr;
    logic [4:0]  rd_addr;
    logic [31:0] rs1_rdata;
    logic [31:0] rs2_rdata;
    logic [31:0] rd_wdata;
    logic [31:0] mem_addr;
    logic [31:0] mem_wdata;
    logic        mem_rmask;
    logic        mem_wmask;
  } tracer_insn_t;

endpackage
```

Write this file using the write tool.

